  <para style="h">Filipi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Filipi bi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filipi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filipi bi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Paulo kɛ Timoteo nɛ a ji Yesu Kristo sɔmɔli, nɛ ngma kɛ ya ha nyɛmimɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli kɛ asafo nɔ hyɛli ngɛ Filipi.<verse eid="PHP 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Tsɛ Mawu nɛ jɔɔ nyɛ tsuo. Ye sɔlemi ji kaa wa Tsɛ Mawu kɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo nɛ jɔɔ nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ babauu nɛ nyɛ na e he jɔmi ɔ ngɛ nyɛ tsui mi kɛ nyɛ si himi mi. <verse eid="PHP 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />I naa Mawu si babauu ke i ngɛ sɔlee kɛ ha nyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />Nɛ ke i sɔle kɛ ha nyɛ ɔ, i naa bua jɔmi, <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />ngɛ nyakpɛ yemi kɛ buami nɛ nyɛ ngɛ hae kɛ ha Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ kɔɔ Kristo he ɔ fiɛmi, kɛ je be mi nɛ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ nu kɛ ba si piɔ nɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />Nɛ i heɔ yeɔ kaa Mawu, nɔ nɛ bɔni ni kpakpa nɛ ɔ tsumi ngɛ nyɛ mi ɔ, e ma tsa nɔ maa ye kɛ bua nyɛ. E ma ha nɛ nyɛɛ wa ngɛ e dloomi ɔ mi kɛ ya si benɛ e maa gbe ni tsumi ɔ nya ngɛ Yesu Kristo bami ekohu ligbi ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="PHP 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo suɔmi nɛ e suɔ mɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />E sa kaa i susuu ja a ngɛ nyɛ he, ejakaa i suɔ nyɛ ngɛ ye tsui mi. Wɔ tsuo wa na Mawu jɔɔmi ɔ, be mi nɛ i ngɛ tsu mi kɛ benɛ i je kpo ɔ, nɛ wa ngɛ anɔkuale ɔ he fae, nɛ wa ngɛ nihi Kristo se blɔ tsɔɔe ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Mawu pɛ nɛ le bɔ nɛ ye hɛ jaa ngɛ nyɛ he ha. <verse eid="PHP 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Ye sɔlemi ji kaa nyɛ na ni kpahi a he suɔmi babauu, nɛ nyɛɛ ya nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ wa ngɛ mumi ɔ he ni lemi mi, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />ejakaa i suɔ kaa nyɛɛ na slɔɔto nɛ ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ hi kɛ nɔ́ nɛ hí kpɛti, nɛ nyɛ mi mi blɔ nɛ tsɔ bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nɔ ko nɛ ko tu nyɛ he munyu yaya kɛ ya si Kristo bami ekohu ligbi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />Nyɛɛ pee nɔ kpakpa kɛ mi mi jɔmi ni ɔmɛ nɛ tsɔɔ kaa Mawu bimɛ ji nyɛ ɔ, ejakaa lɔ ɔ ma ha Nutsɔ ɔ yi jemi, nɛ e maa wo e hɛ mi nyami.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Nɛ anyɛmimɛ, i ngɛ hlae nɛ nyɛɛ le enɛ ɔ kaa, nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ba ye nɔ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ, e maa ye kɛ bua nɛ Kristo Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ e je kpo. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Ejakaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ, kɛ soja amɛ tete, le kaa a wo mi kɔsɔkɔsɔ ngɛ Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ nɛ i ji ɔ he. <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />Nɛ nyɛmimɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli nɛ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ hu a ti nihi babauu yi tsu womi ɔ gbeye hu; nɛ ye tsui si tomi ɔ hu wo mɛ he wami, nɛ a na kã pe kekle ɔ kɛ ngɛ Manye Munyu ɔ jajee.<verse eid="PHP 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />A ti ni komɛ hu ngɛ Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛe, ejakaa a ngɛ mi hunga jee ngɛ bɔ nɛ Mawu ngɔ mi kɛ tsu ni ha a he je. A ngɛ hlae nɛ a tsɛ mɛ fiɛli nɛ yi gbeye. Se a ti ni komɛ hu hɛɛ juɛmi kpakpa <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />kɛ ngɛ fiɛe, ejakaa a suɔ mi nɛ a le kaa Nutsɔ ɔ kɛ mi ba hiɛ ɔ nɛ ma ba fã anɔkuale ɔ he. <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />Ni komɛ hu nɛ ngɛ mi nyɛe ɔ ngɛ fiɛe kɛ hunga jemi kɛ pɛ. A susuu kaa a fiɛmi ɔ ma ha nɛ i ma na nɔ wawɛɛ ngɛ tsu ɔ mi. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Se bɔ fɛɛ bɔ nɛ a juɛmi ɔ ji ɔ, anɔkuale ɔ fɔɔ si kaa a ngɛ Kristo Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛe, nɛ lɔ ɔ haa mi bua jɔmi.<verse eid="PHP 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ye je mi himi he se nami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />Ye bua jɔmi ɔ se be poe, ejakaa i le kaa benɛ nyɛ ngɛ sɔlee ha mi nɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ngɛ yee kɛ ngɛ mi buae ɔ, a ma je mi. <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />Ejakaa i ngɛ blɔ hyɛe kɛ he nɔ kami kaa i be nɔ́ ko pee nɛ zo maa gbe mi. Se mohu, i ma pee klaalo be fɛɛ be, nɛ i ma tu munyu kɛ ka kɛ ha Kristo be mi nɛ i ngɛ nɔ́ nami mi ngɛ hiɛ ɔ, kaa bɔ nɛ i hi mi be ko nɛ be ɔ. Nɛ i he ye kaa i ma pee Kristo hɛ mi nyami wolɔ be fɛɛ be ke i ngɛ je mi jio, i gbo jio. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Ejakaa ngɛ ye blɔ fa mi ɔ, ke i ngɛ wami mi ɔ, e ji he blɔ nɛ i na, nɛ i ma kɛ sɔmɔ Kristo. Nɛ ke i gbo hu e ma ha ma ya Kristo ngɔ nɛ Manye Munyu ɔ maa gbɛ kɛ fia. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Se ke ye je mi himi ma ha nɛ ma na tsakeli fuu kɛ ha Kristo ɔ, lɛɛ i li a ti nɔ́ nɛ hi, kaa ma hi je mi aloo ma gbo. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Be komɛ ɔ, i suɔ kaa ma hi je mi, nɛ be kpa komɛ hu e pee we mi ja, ejakaa i suɔ nɛ ma ya, nɛ i kɛ Kristo ya hi si. E maa pee mi bua jɔmi pe nɛ i ma hi hiɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />Se nyɛ he ɔ, ke i ngɛ je mi ɔ, e maa hi kɛ ha nyɛ.<verse eid="PHP 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Ye he hia ngɛ hiɛ ɔ kɛ sa, nɛ i ngɛ nɔ́ mi mami kaa i kɛ nyɛ maa hi si be saii nɛ ma ye kɛ bua nyɛ nɛ nyɛɛ wa ngɛ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ mi nɛ nyɛ na bua jɔmi. <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />Ke i ngɛ nɛ i ba slaa nyɛ ekohu ɔ, e ma ha nyɛ bua maa jɔ nyɛ he nɛ nyɛ maa wo Kristo Yesu hɛ mi nyami kaa e ngɛ ye yi baae.<verse eid="PHP 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Se ngɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ́ nɛ maa ba ye nɔ mi ɔ, nɔ́ nɛ he hia ji kaa nyɛ kai be fɛɛ be, nɛ nyɛɛ ba nyɛ je mi bɔ nɛ sa Kristo se nyɛɛli; konɛ i ba nyɛ ngɔ jio, i kɛ nyɛ kpí hu jio, i ma hi nyɛ he munyu kpakpa nue kaa nyɛ ngɛ kake, nɛ nyɛ hɛɛ juɛmi kake kɛ ngɛ Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛe; <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />nɛ nyɛ yi nyɛ he nyɛli ɔmɛ gbeye ngɛ nɔ́ ko nɔ ko mi. Enɛ ɔ maa tsɔɔ mɛ kaa a gbee si, se nyɛɛ lɛɛ e ji okadi nɛ je Mawu ngɔ kɛ ba ha nyɛ, nɛ tsɔɔ kaa e kɛ nyɛ ngɛ nɛ e ha nyɛ neneene wami. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Ejakaa nyɛɛ lɛɛ a dloo nyɛ, pi nɛ nyɛ kɛ he e nɔ nyɛɛ ye kɛkɛ, se nɛ nyɛ kɛ na nɔ́ ngɛ e he. <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />I kɛ nyɛ tsuo nɛ ngɛ ta nɛ ɔ hwue. Nyɛ na kaa i na nɔ́ ngɛ e he ngɛ be nɛ be ɔ mi, nɛ i ngɛ ta nɛ nya wa mi kɛ sa kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ le ɔ.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="s1">Nyɛɛ kase Kristo suɔmi ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Anɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli woɔ a bi he wami? Anɛ nyɛ suɔ mi bɔ nɛ e maa hia kaa nyɛɛ ye ke bua mi? Nyɛ nuɔ he kaa nyɛmimɛ ji wɔ ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi, nɛ Mumi kake too ɔ nɛ ngɛ wɔ tsuo wa mi? Anɛ nyɛ tsui mi hi nɛ nyɛ naa mɔbɔ lo? <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />Lɛɛ nyɛɛ suɔ nyɛ he nɛ nyɛɛ hi si saminya. Nyɛɛ hɛɛ oti kake, nɛ nyɛɛ pee kake kɛ juɛmi kake kɛ tsu ni, nɛ nyɛ ha nɛ ye bua nɛ jɔ ye he anɔkuale mi.<verse eid="PHP 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Nyɛ ko fo nyɛ kɛkɛ nyɛ nɔ́ mi; nyɛ ko kale nyɛ he. Nyɛɛ ba nyɛ he si, nɛ nyɛ susu ni kpahi a he pe nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ he. <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />Nyɛ ko susu nyɛ kɛkɛ nyɛ níhi a he, se nyɛ na deka kɛ ha ni kpahi hulɔ.<verse eid="PHP 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Nyɛɛ ba nyɛ je mi kaa wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo. <verse eid="PHP 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />Mawu ji lɛ mohu, se e dí e Mawu nɛ e ji ɔ se. <verse eid="PHP 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Nɛ e si e he wami kɛ e anunyami nɛ e ngɛ ɔ, nɛ e pee e he sɔmɔlɔ nɛ a fɔ lɛ kaa nɔmlɔ. <verse eid="PHP 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />E ba e he si hluu kɛ ya su gbenɔ mi tete ngɛ sɛumi tso nɔ.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ Mawu wo e nɔ gojoo ngɛ, nɛ e ha lɛ biɛ nɛ pã biɛ fɛɛ biɛ, <verse eid="PHP 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />konɛ nakutso fɛɛ nakutso nɛ kpla si kɛ ha Yesu biɛ ɔ ngɛ hiɔwe kɛ zugba a nɔ kɛ e sisi, <verse eid="PHP 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />nɛ lilɛ tsuaa lilɛ nɛ jaje ke Yesu Kristo ji Nutsɔ kɛ wo Mawu nɛ ji Tsɛ ɔ hɛ mi nyami.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Suɔli, be mi nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ ngɔ ɔ, nyɛ buɔ ye munyu ɔmɛ tue. Se jehanɛ ɔ nɛ i be nyɛ ngɔ ɔ, e sa kaa nyɛɛ bɔ mɔde nɛ nyɛɛ pee nɔ́ kpakpahi nɛ tsɔɔ kaa a he nyɛ yi wami. Nyɛɛ bu Mawu tue kɛ he si bami saminya. Nɛ nyɛ je nyɛ he kɛ je nihi nɛ e sume ɔmɛ a he. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Ejakaa Mawu ɔ ngɛ ni tsue ngɛ nyɛ mi, e ngɛ yee kɛ ngɛ nyɛ buae nɛ nyɛɛ bu lɛ tue nɛ nyɛɛ pee e suɔmi nya ni.<verse eid="PHP 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Nyɛɛ pee nyɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ munyu hwitihwiti kɛ nya sami nɛ ko hi mi, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />konɛ piami ko nɛ ko hi nyɛ he. Nyɛɛ hi si himi nɛ he tsɔ kaa Mawu bimɛ, nɛ a ko na piami ko ngɛ nyɛ he ngɛ diblii je nɛ ɔ nɛ hyi tɔ kɛ nimli gɔdɔgɔdɔ kɛ tue mi tili ɔ mi. Nyɛ kpɛ ngɛ a kpɛti kaa blɔ tsɔɔmi kanehi, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />nɛ nyɛ je wami munyu ɔ kpo kɛ tsɔɔ mɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 2:16">Konɛ ke Kristo kpale kɛ ba a, ma na bua jɔmi kaa ye ni nɛ i tsu ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti ɔ, e pee we yaka gu. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Nɛ ke a ma pue ye muɔ si kaa bɔ sami kɛ ha Mawu ngɛ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi he, nɛ tsɔɔ kaa, ke i ma gbo kɛ ha nyɛ ɔ, lɔ ɔ tete ye bua maa jɔ he, nɛ nyɛ hu nyɛ ma na bua jɔmi . <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Nɛ e sa kaa nyɛ bua nɛ jɔ enɛ ɔ he, nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ mi nɛ nya kaa i na he blɔ nɛ ɔ nɛ i gbo kɛ ha nyɛ.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo hɛ ja ngɛ e huɛmɛ a he</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Ke Mawu suɔ ɔ, e be kɛe nɛ i ma tsɔ Timoteo kɛ ba nyɛ ngɔ. Nɛ ke e kpale kɛ ba a, e ma ba bɔ mi nyɛ he sane kɛ wo mi he wami. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Nɔ ko nɔ ko be nɛ ngɛ nyɛ he suɔmi kaa Timoteo. <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />Nɔ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ lɛ nitsɛ e níhi a he susue, se pi Yesu Kristo níhi. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Se nyɛ le Timoteo, e ngɛ kaa ye bi. E ngɛ yee kɛ ngɛ mi buae ngɛ Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛmi mi. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />I ma suɔ nɛ ma tsɔ lɛ kɛ ba nyɛ ngɔ nɔuu ke i le nɔ́ nɛ maa ba ye nɔ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Nɛ i heɔ yeɔ kaa e be kɛe nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ ma ha nɛ ami nitsɛ hu ma ba nyɛ ngɔ.<verse eid="PHP 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Se i susu kaa e sa nɛ ma tsɔ wa nyɛmi Epafrodito kɛ kpale kɛ ba nyɛ ngɔ. Nyɛ tsɔ lɛ nɛ e ba ye kɛ bua mi ngɛ ye hiami ɔ mi. I kɛ lɛ wa pee nyɛmi kɛ ngɛ ta kake hwue. <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ i kpale ngɛ lɛ tsɔe kɛ ba we, ejakaa e hɛ ngɛ jae ngɛ nyɛ tsuo nyɛ he, nɛ e hao hulɔ, ejakaa nyɛ nu kaa e be he wami. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Nɛ e be he wami niinɛ. Anɔkuale mi ɔ, e piɛ bɔɔ nɛ e gbo. Se Mawu na imi kɛ lɛ tsuo mɔbɔ nɛ e ha we nɛ kikɛmɛ a aywilɛho sane nɛ ɔ nɛ ba piɛ ye haomi ɔmɛ a he.<verse eid="PHP 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Enɛ ɔ he je titli nɛ i ngɛ lɛ nyɛ ngɔ tsɔe ekohu ngɛ; nɛ i le bɔ nɛ nyɛ bua maa jɔ nyɛ he ha ke nyɛ na lɛ ɔ. Nɛ ami hu i ma na bua jɔmi nɛ ye kɔmɔ yemi ɔ se maa po bɔɔ. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ he lɛ atuu kɛ bua jɔmi babauu ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ biɛ mi. Ejakaa nihi kaa kikɛ ɔ, a sa hɛ mi nyami womi. <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />E ngɔ e he wami tsuo kɛ ha Kristo ni tsumi ɔ, nɛ e piɛ bɔɔ nɛ e ko gbo benɛ e ngɛ yee kɛ ngɛ mi buae kɛ tsu ni tsumihi nɛ nyɛ nyɛ we nyɛ tsu ɔ, ejakaa i kɛ nyɛ wa kpɛti kɛ ɔ.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Ye suɔli, nyagbe mi ɔ, bɔ fɛɛ bɔ nɛ e ji ɔ, nyɛ bua nɛ jɔ ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi. Pɔ tɔɛ ye he kaa ma hi nyɛ enɛ ɔ dee, ejakaa e hi kaa nyɛɛ hi enɛ ɔ nue be fɛɛ be.<verse eid="PHP 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lakpa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Nyɛɛ hyɛ nyɛ he saminya ngɛ jamɛ a yi mi wali kɛ awi yeli ɔmɛ nɛ deɔ ke ja a wo nyɛ nyumu mi loko ji a ma he nyɛ yi wami ɔ a he. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Ejakaa tsa pi wa nɔmlɔ tso ɔmɛ a pomi nɛ peeɔ wɔ Mawu bimɛ, se mohu wa jami nɛ wa jaa lɛ ngɛ mumi mi ɔ. Lɔ ɔ pɛ ji anɔkuale “nyumu mi womi.” Nɛ wɔ Kristo se nyɛɛli wa naa bua jɔmi ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ Kristo Yesu tsu kɛ ha wɔ ɔ he. Nɛ wa yo kaa wa be nyɛe ma he wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa yi wami.<verse eid="PHP 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />Se kɛ ɔ, ke nɔ ko ngɛ nɛ e ngɛ hɛ nɔ kami ko kaa e ma nyɛ he lɛ nitsɛ e yi wami ɔ, lɛɛ ami i. Nɛ ke a ma nyɛ he ni komɛ a yi wami ngɛ bɔ nɛ a ji he je ɔ, lɛɛ ami hu ma de ke a ma he ye yi wami. <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />Ejakaa i gu Yuda bi ɔmɛ a kusumi ɔmɛ a mi. Benɛ i ye ligbi kpaanyɔ ɔ, a wo mi nyumu mi. Yuda no fɔfɔɛ ji mi, nɛ i je Benyami wɛtso ɔ mi. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, Yuda no tutuutu ji mi. Nɔ́ nɛ pe lɔ ɔ hu ji kaa, i piɛ Farisi bi ɔmɛ nɛ hyɛɔ kaa a ye Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaahi kɛ kusumi ɔmɛ a nɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ ɔ he. <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />Anɛ i ye anɔkuale ngɛ mi lo? Ee, i ye anɔkuale bɔ nɛ ma nyɛ, nɛ i wa asafo ɔ yi mi saminya. Nɛ i bɔ mɔde kaa ma ye Yuda bi ɔmɛ a mlaahi kɛ blɔ nya tomi ɔmɛ kulaa nɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ.<verse eid="PHP 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Se ní nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ a ji se nami kɛ ha mi sa a, i sake mɛ kɛ pue he, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma ngɔ ye hɛ kɛ fɔ Kristo nɔ, nɛ ma he lɛ pɛ e nɔ ma ye. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Ee, i buu nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ kaa níhi nɛ a he be se nami ke ji i kɛ to se nami nɛ ngɛ Kristo Yesu, ye Nutsɔ ɔ lemi he ɔ. I sake enɛ ɔmɛ tsuo kɛ fɔ se, ejakaa a he be se nami kulaa, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ ma ngɔ Kristo, <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />nɛ i kɛ lɛ nɛ pee kake. Nɛ ma ko susu kaa ye dami he je nɛ a he ye yi wami ngɛ, aloo Mawu mlaa amɛ a nɔ yemi he, se Kristo nɔ hemi kɛ yemi he. Ejakaa Kristo nɔ hemi kɛ yemi kɛkɛ nɔ Mawu guu kɛ dlaa waa kɛ lɛ wa kpɛti. <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, i ngmɛɛ ni kpa amɛ kulaa a he. I na kaa kɛ gu lɔ ɔ nɔ nɛ ma nyɛ ma pee Kristo nɔ anɔkuale mi, nɛ ma na he wami agbo nɛ tle lɛ si kɛ je gbeje ɔ. Nɛ ma hla nɔ nɛ e ji kaa i kɛ lɛ nɛ na nɔ, nɛ i kɛ lɛ nɛ gbo ɔ sisi. <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, bɔ fɛɛ bɔ nɛ e ji ha a, i ma hi kaa ni nɛmɛ nɛ a te si kɛ je gbeje nɛ a na wami he ɔ.<verse eid="PHP 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />I de we ke i hi kɛ pi si, ejakaa i kase we nɔ fɛɛ nɔ́ nɛ sa kaa ma kase ɔ lolo, se mohu i ngɛ mɔde bɔe kɛ ha jamɛ a ligbi ɔ nɛ ye nine maa su nɔ́ nɛ Kristo he ye yi wami kɛ ha a nɔ, kɛ nɔ nɛ e ngɛ mi hlae kaa ma pee ɔ.<verse eid="PHP 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Suɔli, i na we ma pee bɔ nɛ sa kaa ma hi tutuutu ɔ lolo, se i ngɛ nɔ́ kake too nɛ ɔ he mɔde bɔe kɛ ye he wami kulaa, kaa ye hɛ nɛ je níhi nɛ be ɔmɛ a nɔ, nɛ ma hyɛ níhi nɛ ngɛ ye hɛ mi ɔ blɔ. <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />Nɛ i ngɛ dengme gboe nɛ ma ya su oti ɔ he, nɛ ye nine nɛ su jlasi ɔ nɔ; nɔ́ nɛ he je nɛ Mawu ngɛ wɔ tsɛe kɛ yaa hiɔwe ɔ, ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ Kristo Yesu tsu kɛ ha wɔ ɔ he je ɔ.<verse eid="PHP 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />I heɔ yeɔ kaa nyɛ nihi kulaa nɛ nyɛ wa ngɛ Kristo jami ɔ mi ɔ, nyɛɛ kɛ mi ma kpa gbi ngɛ ni nɛ ɔmɛ a he, nɛ ke nyɛɛ kɛ mi kpa we gbi ngɛ ekomɛ a he ɔ, i ngɛ hɛ nɔ kami kaa Mawu ma je mɛ kpo paa kɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ, <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />ke ji nyɛ ye anɔkuale ɔ nɛ a kɛ ha nyɛ ɔ nɔ pɛpɛɛpɛ ɔ.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Nyɛmimɛ suɔli, nyɛɛ hi si kaa bɔ nɛ i ngɛ ɔ, nɛ nyɛɛ hyɛ nihi hu nɛ ngɛ kaa ami ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Ejakaa i de nyɛ hyɛ si abɔ, nɛ i ngɛ nyɛ dee ekohu kɛ ye hɛ mi vo nyu, kaa nihi fuu ngɛ nɛ a peeɔ a he Kristo se nyɛɛli, se ngɛ anɔkuale mi ɔ, Kristo sɛumi tso ɔ he nyɛli ji mɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />A nyagbe maa pee hɛ mi kpatami. A mawu ji a muklii, nɛ a fĩaa ngɛ níhi nɛ e sa nɛ zo nɛ pee mɛ ngɛ he. Zugba nɛ ɔ nɔ si himi he pɛ a susuɔ. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Se wɔɔ lɛɛ wa we ngɛ hiɔwe, he nɛ wa Yiwamihelɔ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo ngɛ ɔ. Nɛ nɔ nɛ wa ngɛ blɔ hyɛe ji kaa e maa kpale kɛ je lejɛ ɔ kɛ ba. <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />Ke e kpale kɛ ba a, e maa ngɔ wa nɔmlɔ tsohi nɛ gboɔ nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ e ma tsake mɛ kɛ pee nɔmlɔ tsohi nɛ hɛ mi ngɛ anunyami kaa e nɔ́ ɔ, ngɛ e he wami nɛ e ngɛ ngɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ́ nɔ ɔ nya.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="s1">Paulo slɔmi ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Mamimɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli, i suɔ nyɛ, nɛ ye hɛ jaa ngɛ nyɛ he, ejakaa nyɛ ji ye bua jɔmi kɛ ye ni tsumi ɔ he se nami. Mamimɛ nɛ a suɔ, nyɛɛ da si kpɛii ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Jehanɛ ɔ, i ngɛ nyɛmimɛ yihi enyɔ ɔmɛ, Evodia kɛ Sintika, pɛɛ kpae kaa a juɛmi nɛ pee kake ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi, nɛ a ko pɛ hu. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Nɛ i ngɛ mo hu ye he piɛlɔ tutuutu ɔ dee ke, o ye kɛ bua yi nɛ ɔmɛ, ejakaa a kɛ mi tsu ni kɛ fiɛɛ Manye Munyu ɔ kɛ ha nihi. Nɛ a kɛ Klemente kɛ ye nyɛmimɛ kpa amɛ hu tsu ni, nihi nɛ a ngma a biɛ ngɛ Wami Womi ɔ mi ɔ.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Nyɛ bua nɛ jɔ ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi be fɛɛ be. I ngɛ nyɛ dee ekohu ke, nyɛ bua nɛ jɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Nyɛ ha nɛ a na nyɛ kaa nyɛ fo we nyɛ kɛkɛ nyɛ nɔ́ mi, nɛ nyɛ susu ɔ ni kpahi a he ngɛ nyɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ peemi mi. Nyɛ kai kaa Nutsɔ ɔ ma ngɛ be kpiti mi. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Nyɛ ko hao ngɛ nɔ́ ko nɔ́ ko he, se mohu nyɛɛ sɔle ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ́ he, nɛ nyɛ de Mawu nyɛ hiami nihi. Nɛ ke e ha nyɛ heto ɔ, nyɛ hɛ ko je nɔ nɛ nyɛɛ na lɛ si ngɛ he. <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />Nɛ Mawu he jɔmi nɛ adesa ko juɛmi sui he ɔ, e maa bu nyɛ tsuihi kɛ nyɛ juɛmihi a he ngɛ Yesu Kristo mi.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Mamimɛ, loko ma gbe womi nɛ ɔ nya a, ma de nyɛ nɔ́ kake nɛ ɔ hu: Nyɛɛ ngɔ nyɛ juɛmi kɛ fɔ nɔ́ nɛ ji anɔkuale ɔ nɔ, nɔ́ nɛ hi kɛ nɔ́ nɛ da. Nyɛ susu níhi nɛ he tsɔ nɛ ngɛ fɛu he. Nɛ nyɛ susu níhi kulaa nɛ hia kaa nyɛ je Mawu yi ngɛ he, nɛ ma ha nyɛ bua jɔmi ɔ he. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Nɛ níhi kulaa nɛ nyɛ kase kɛ je ye ngɔ, kɛ níhi nɛ nyɛ na nɛ i pee ɔ, nyɛɛ hi pee; nɛ he jɔmi Mawu ɔ kɛ nyɛ maa hi si.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />I naa Nutsɔ ɔ si, nɛ i ngɛ e yi jee kaa nyɛ ngɛ yee kɛ ngɛ mi buae ekohu. I le kaa nyɛ suɔ be tsuaa be kaa nyɛ maa mane mi nɔ́ ko, se be saii ji nɛ ɔ nɛ nyɛ na we he blɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />E tsɔɔ we kaa nɔ́ ko he ngɛ mi hiae mohu, ejakaa i kase bɔ nɛ sa nɛ ma hi si ha ngɛ bua jɔmi mi, ke i ngɛ níhi fuu aloo nɔ́ ko bɔɔ pɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />I le bɔ nɛ ma hi si ha, ke i be nɔ́ ko kulaa, aloo i ngɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ. I kase laami nɔ́ ko nɛ ngɛ si himi mi, bɔ nɛ a naa bua jɔmi ngɛ si himi fɛɛ si himi mi, ke o tɔ jio, hwɔ ngɛ mo yee jio, o na ni fuu aloo o be nɔ́ ko. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, ma nyɛ ma pee nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ Mawu bi mi kaa ma pee ɔ kɛ gu Kristo, nɔ nɛ haa mi he wami ɔ e yemi kɛ buami nɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Se kɛ ɔ, nyɛ pee bɔ nɛ sa, kaa nyɛ ye kɛ bua mi ngɛ ye haomi ɔmɛ a mi.<verse eid="PHP 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Jehanɛ ɔ, nyɛ Filipi bi, nyɛ nitsɛmɛ hu nyɛ le klɛdɛɛ kaa benɛ i je Makedonia ngɛ Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛmi sisije be ɔmɛ a mi ɔ, nyɛ pɛ ji asafo nɛ ye kɛ bua mi. <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />Nɛ benɛ i ngɛ Tesalonika tete po ɔ, ye nine su nyɛ yemi kɛ buami nɔ si enyɔ sɔuu. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Nɛ e ngɛ mi kaa ye bua jɔ nyɛ nike ni ɔmɛ a he mohu, se nɔ́ nɛ pee mi bua jɔmi pe kulaa ji hiɔwo nɛ nyɛ ma na ngɛ nyɛ mi mi jɔmi ɔ he ɔ.<verse eid="PHP 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ́ nɛ he ngɛ mi hiae ɔ, ye nine su nɔ, nɛ e be nɔ po. Nyɛ mane mi nike níhi benɛ Epafrodito ma a. A ji bɔ sami níhi nɛ jee via nɛ Mawu suɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Nɛ Mawu ji nɔ nɛ ma ha nyɛ nyɛ hiami ni ɔmɛ kɛ je e anunyami nihi fuu nɛ e ngɛ ɔ mi, kɛ gu Kristo Yesu nɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />A ngɔ anunyami kɛ ha Mawu wa Tsɛ ɔ kɛ ya neneene. Amen.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyagbe sɛ yemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Nyɛ nga Kristo se nyɛɛli kulaa nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ kɛ ha mi. Nyɛmimɛ nɛ kɛ mi ngɛ hiɛ ɔ hu ke a biɔ nyɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Nɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli kpahi nɛ ngɛ hiɛ ɔ hu ke a ngɛ nyɛ ngae, titli ɔ, ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ ni tsue ngɛ Kaisare we ɔ mi ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo jɔɔmi ɔ kɛ nyɛ mumi nɛ hi si.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>